      "text": "New research\nWeb apps\niOS apps\nStyles\nPricing\nConnect MCP\nFigma Plugin\nLog In/Sign Up\nConnect MCP\nDesign Research for the AI Era\nReal product screens, flows, and patterns to help designers, builders and AI make better design decisions.\nMeet new research mode\nDescribe your task, get analysis, references, and reasoning back.\nResearch mode\nWeb apps\niOS apps\nStyles\nPopular\nInspiration\nOnboarding\nWorkflows\nData tables with filters\nPaywalls with plan selection\nAI chat with sources and citations\nSaaS landing pages with product screenshots\nCommand palette examples\nSocial media publishing dashboards\nPage Types\nDashboardProduct Page & LandingPaywall & SubscriptionLog InProduct DetailsProfile & Account404 PageCatalog PageBlogAboutCareersContactsDevelopers PageIntegration PageMedia Kit\nMore\nDashboard\nScreens\nFlows\nSigning Up & OnboardingLogging InSubscribingAdding to CartAdding & CreatingChatting & MessagingEditingDeleting AccountResetting PasswordBookingMoney TransferringPersonalizing & CustomizingMedia EditingDesign EditingUploading & Downloading\nMore\nSigning Up & Onboarding\nFlows\nUX Patterns\nTestimonialsFilter & SortingReviews & RatingStatsSearchingChecklist & To DoBilling & PlansPayment MethodDark ModeMoney TransferShoppingTrial & FreemiumActivity & Notification FeedArticle & TextAudio Player\nMore\nTestimonials\nScreens\nUI Elements\nDialog & Modal WindowCards & TilesColor PickerMapTableTabsSkeletonIllustrationLine & Bar ChartFooterNavigation BarSidebar & DrawerToolbar3d IllustrationAnimation\nMore\nDialog & Modal Window\nScreens\nSites\nAI ToolBooksBusinessCollaboration ToolsCommunication ToolsDesign & Media EditingDevelopment ToolsEducationElectronic & DevicesEntertainmentFinanceFitnessFood & DrinkFood DeliveryFundraising\nLog In or Sign Up\nContinue with Google\nor\nContinue with Email\nBy continuing, you agree to our Privacy Policy and Terms of Use.\n\nDesign Research for the AI era\n\nPricing\nRefero MCP\nFigma Plug